# Quick Start Guide 🚀

Get started with the Shakespeare Dataset in 5 minutes!

## Installation

### Option 1: Clone the Repository
```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/shakespeare-dataset.git
cd shakespeare-dataset
```

### Option 2: Download Just the Data
```bash
# Download only the dataset file
curl -O https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yourusername/shakespeare-dataset/main/final_dataset.txt
```

